#: src/fremdtexte.rs:179
msgid "Not Authorized"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:180
msgid ""
"Permission to manage software was not granted. Either the authorization dialog was cancelled, the password was wrong, or the policy (polkit) does not allow this action for your account."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:185
msgid ""
"Try again and confirm the authorization dialog, or contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:191
msgid "Authorization Dialog Missing"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:192
msgid ""
"The session’s authorization dialog (polkit agent) is missing. Without it, no program can install or remove packages. Querencia Session (G2-K) provides it as “querencia-polkit-agent”."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:197
msgid ""
"Start the authorization dialog from a terminal in the session (“querencia-polkit-agent”) or log in again once it is set up, then repeat the operation."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:204
msgid "Package Manager Is Busy"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:206
msgid ""
"Another program is using the package manager right now, for example automatic updates (unattended-upgrades) or “apt” in a terminal."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another program is using the package manager right now: {program}. As long as it is running, Querencia Software cannot change any packages."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:217
msgid ""
"Wait until the other program has finished; Querencia Software tries again every 10 seconds (for up to 5 minutes). Or cancel."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:223
msgid "No Network Connection"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:224
msgid ""
"The software sources cannot be reached. Either there is no connection to the internet, or the mirror server does not respond."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:228
msgid "Check the network connection and then try again."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:231
msgid "Package Not Found"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The package “{package}” is not available in the configured software sources, or the list of sources is out of date."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:237
msgid ""
"Refresh the software sources (File → Check for Updates) and search again."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:240
msgid "Dependencies Cannot Be Resolved"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:241
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The change conflicts with other installed packages or needs packages that are not available. Message from the package manager: {details}"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:246
msgid ""
"Leave the system unchanged; check the updates or resolve the conflict with an expert tool (apt)."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:252
msgid "Lost Connection to the Package Manager"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:253
msgid ""
"The PackageKit service was stopped or restarted during the operation. Querencia Software tried once to resume the operation; that did not succeed. The package database stays consistent, but the operation may not have finished."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:259
msgid ""
"Check whether the package is installed (view “Installed”) and repeat the operation if necessary."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:265
msgid "Operation Cancelled"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:266
msgid ""
"The operation was cancelled at your request. Files already downloaded stay in the cache. If the cancellation only took effect during setup, some packages may already be installed or removed."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:271
msgid ""
"If necessary, check the state in the view “Installed”, and start the operation again if you want to carry it out after all."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:277
msgid "Package Manager Does Not Respond"
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:278
msgid ""
"PackageKit did not answer in time. The service may be overloaded or hanging."
msgstr ""

#: src/fremdtexte.rs:279
msgid ""
"Try again in a few minutes. If that does not help, log in again or restart the computer."
msgstr ""

